package views

// AboutPage tells the family story. Draft copy from confirmed facts. Edit freely.
templ AboutPage(l Layout) {
	@Base(l) {
		<section class="page">
			<h1>About us</h1>
			<p class="page-lede">
				We are a family-run workshop, a father and his two sons, with more than
				fifty years of combined experience between us.
			</p>
			<p>
				We have spent those years specialising in Hino trucks and Toyota Hilux
				bakkies: the light-duty Hino 300, the medium-duty Hino 500 and the
				heavy-duty Hino 700, and the Hilux in D4D 2.5, D4D 3.0, GD6 2.4 and
				GD6 2.8. It is what we know best.
			</p>
			<p>
				That focus is why Gauteng fleets like Fidelity trust us to keep their
				vehicles moving. We work with fleet operators only, from around five
				vehicles up to about a hundred, so what we do is planned maintenance
				built around your operating cycle rather than whatever comes through
				the door.
			</p>
			<p>
				Being a small family business, you deal with the owners directly. The
				person who answers the phone knows the vehicle and can give you an
				answer immediately, rather than a reference number and a call back
				tomorrow. We would rather look after your fleet for years than make
				money on a single job, which is why your rate improves as more of
				your vehicles come to us.
			</p>
			<p>
				When a truck or bakkie is off the road, the business behind it is too.
				If one goes down before 17:00 we will arrange recovery to get it to
				us. Getting you back to work quickly is the whole point of what we do.
			</p>
		</section>
	}
}
